message:
The daily incremental Algolia sync has produced no successful push in 48h (AECI-139, 08:00 UTC = 03:00 EST cron). A healthy run emits `aeci.algolia.sync{outcome:ok,trigger:cron}` for every entity even when nothing changed, so a silent `outcome:ok` series means the cron (apps/api/src/scheduled.ts) is not running — every env index is quietly going stale with no page-level symptom. This is the liveness companion to 'AECi — Algolia sync failed' (which catches per-push failures); it relies on notify_no_data, so the `outcome:ok` scope is load-bearing — do NOT point it at `outcome:failed`.

Runbook: https://github.com/the-wbs-project/aec-integrations/blob/main/docs/RUNBOOKS.md#algolia-sync-failed

